{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cep8ighyb2CkcHG4bZAJZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented the `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint for the shipment feature. Here's what was done:\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **ApiError.kt** — Added new error code\n   - `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE_FOR_CONFIRM` for 409 Conflict responses when trying to confirm a cancelled shipment\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt** — Added confirm endpoint\n   - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint\n   - Handles all required state transitions and error cases:\n     - **CREATED → CONFIRMED**: Transitions the shipment and persists it\n     - **CONFIRMED → CONFIRMED**: Idempotent (retry-safe) — returns unchanged\n     - **CANCELLED**: Returns HTTP 409 with appropriate error code\n     - **Non-existent**: Returns HTTP 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error\n\n3. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added comprehensive tests\n   - Confirms CREATED shipment transitions to CONFIRMED\n   - Confirms idempotency (retry succeeds)\n   - Confirms CANCELLED shipment is rejected with 409\n   - Confirms unknown shipment returns 404\n\n### Acceptance Criteria Met\n\n✅ Existing build passes  \n✅ All 17 tests pass (including 4 new confirm tests, 5 existing shipment tests)  \n✅ Endpoint confirms created shipments and persists them  \n✅ Error responses use consistent API envelope pattern  \n✅ Idempotency and error handling work correctly  \n✅ No new Maven dependencies added  \n✅ Only shipment feature files modified (+ api for error code)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":496,"cache_read_input_tokens":41553,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":496},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo